config ESP8089
	tristate "Espressif ESP8089 SDIO wireless support"
	depends on MMC && MAC80211
	help
	  Support for the Espressif ESP8089 2.4 GHz SDIO wireless chip in
	  station mode. Requires espressif/esp8089-cal-v19.bin and
	  espressif/esp8089-txr8-v1.bin in the firmware search path.
	  The runtime firmware must support the TXR8 and PWR1 interfaces;
	  an incompatible firmware is rejected during probe.

	  To compile this driver as a module, choose M here. The module
	  will be called esp8089.

config ESP8089_KUNIT_TEST
	tristate "KUnit tests for ESP8089 firmware and protocol" if !KUNIT_ALL_TESTS
	depends on KUNIT && ESP8089
	default KUNIT_ALL_TESTS
	help
	  Exercise firmware bounds, unaligned descriptors, transfer padding,
	  credit geometry, RX metadata, negotiated BA windows and compact
	  completion validation. These tests need
	  no device or downloaded firmware and build separately from the driver.
	  The module will be called esp8089-test.
